失败 1：project-intake.spec.ts
  Error: expect(locator).toBeVisible() failed
  Locator: getByText('当前范围：本周先确认设备可用性')
  Error: strict mode violation: getByText(...) resolved to 2 elements:
    1) <p ...>当前范围：本周先确认设备可用性（到 11/9/2026, 12:00:00 AM）</p>
    2) <p role="status" ...>已按你的话调整当前范围：本周先确认设备可用性</p>
